# Server-side appointment automation (configure in Render secrets, never NEXT_PUBLIC_*).
# Render Cron command: npm run appointments:process-outbox
# Create GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN with Google Calendar API scope calendar.events.
# Schedule the Render Cron job every minute and share the web service's Firebase variables.
